# 0268 = 0267 + bounded TX rebuild (ruby_txreset=1): when the TX FIFO is
#   full and deq makes no progress, ignore the pseudo-active readback and
#   run TQ_STOP -> flush -> EP_RST -> reprogram -> Q_START(deq), rate-limited.
